# WORKLOG — Complete Premium UI/UX Redesign & Implementation

## ROLE

Act as a world-class Principal Product Designer, Creative Director, Senior Frontend Engineer, and Motion Designer.

You are redesigning an existing production application called **WORKLOG**.

Your design quality should be comparable to products created by the best product design teams in the world.

Use the design philosophy and quality standards of:

- Apple: refined typography, material depth, elegant transitions, contextual interfaces, and attention to detail.
- Linear: exceptional information hierarchy, sophisticated dark interfaces, precise spacing, and minimal visual noise.
- Stripe: professional data visualization, clean forms, consistent components, and excellent usability.
- Raycast: polished interactions, keyboard-driven workflows, responsive controls, and delightful microinteractions.
- Vercel: technically excellent web interfaces, consistency, accessibility, and responsive layouts.

Do not copy these products. Understand what makes their interfaces exceptional and create an original visual identity for WORKLOG.

**Your task is to actually redesign and implement the existing application, not merely produce a design concept, mockup, or list of suggestions.**

